# Changelog

## 0.1.0 (2026-05-29)

### Initial launch

- Zero-dependency core tracing: `trace()`, `agent()`, `tool()`, `llm()` and 14 more span-kind decorators
- `observe()` universal decorator for manual instrumentation
- `AsyncLocalStorage`-based context propagation with `setContext()` / `getContext()`
- Auto-instrumentation for OpenAI and Anthropic SDKs (monkey-patch-free via `BaseInstrumentor`)
- LangChain callback handler (`EtraceLangChainHandler`) for framework-native tracing
- `RunTracker` for framework-agnostic run-based tracing with parent-child nesting
- `InMemoryExporter`, `ConsoleExporter`, `OtelExporter` (OTLP/protobuf)
- `SimpleProcessor`, `BatchProcessor`, `MultiProcessor` pipeline
- Automatic cost calculation from model pricing catalog
- Auto-shutdown on process exit (`SIGINT`, `SIGTERM`)
- 317 tests passing
